{
  "name": "bmm",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "bun scripts/db-init.mjs && next dev",
    "build": "bun scripts/db-init.mjs -P && next build",
    "start": "bun scripts/db-init.mjs -P && next start",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "test": "vitest",
    "studio": "drizzle-kit studio",
    "检测数据库能否连接": "⬇️",
    "db:test": "bun scripts/db-test.mjs",
    "执行数据库初始化/迁移": "⬇️",
    "db:migrate": "bun scripts/db-migration.mjs",
    "db:backfill-host-keys": "bun scripts/backfill-bookmark-host-keys.mjs",
    "根据项目中的 schema，更新数据库（忽略 migrations，可能会导致数据丢失）": "⬇️",
    "db:push": "bun scripts/db-push.mjs",
    "user:list": "bun scripts/list-users.mjs",
    "user:reset-password": "bun scripts/reset-user-password.mjs",
    "以上这些命令行均允许加上 -P 或 --production，以加载正式环境变量，如 bun run db:test -P": ""
  },
  "packageManager": "bun@1.3.14",
  "engines": {
    "bun": ">=1.3.14"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible": "^2.0.51",
